WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.167
Exclusive new

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:01.801
reporting this

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:04.838
morning about China's air ship program.

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:06.272
We have never before

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:07.107
seen photos

00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:08.975
obtained by CNN

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:10.677
of a Chinese military blimp

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:11.711
was caught on satellite

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:12.946
in a remote desert base

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:14.114
in northwestern China.

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:15.482
You can see it right there.

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:17.517
These pictures are from November 2022,

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:18.518
which is three months

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:20.553
before a Chinese spy

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:22.022
Blue was shot down off the coast

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:23.490
of South Carolina.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.692
CNN's Alex Marquardt joins us now.

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:26.860
Alex, you're part of the reporting team

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:27.360
that's broke

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.229
broke this story about this balloon

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:30.630
What are we looking at?

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.999
Why is this important?

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:33.666
Yeah, John,

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:34.167
my colleague

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:34.601
Paul Murphy

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:35.702
and I obtained these images

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:36.736
from a satellite imagery

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:38.371
company called Black Sky.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:39.973
And what they show

00:00:39.973 --> 00:00:41.074
is what we believe

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:41.441
to be

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:43.410
some part of the Chinese military arsenal

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:46.012
that has never been seen before.

00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:49.082
These images taken at a base in the

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:50.383
in an area called Corolla

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.584
in northwestern China.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:53.753
It is a remote desert base

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:55.321
that is associated

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:57.323
with the Chinese military. The play.

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:57.991
This is an area

00:00:57.991 --> 00:00:59.392
that has been studied for years.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:01.361
We've seen other satellite imagery

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:02.562
of that base.

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:04.864
But what we've never seen before

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:06.433
is a blimp

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:07.333
that is associated

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:08.802
with the Chinese military

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:10.336
it is on that long runway

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:12.405
that is about 3300 feet long.

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:15.542
The blimp itself is about 100 feet

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:16.976
or 30 meters long.

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:19.212
It's just outside a huge hangar.

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:21.047
And what this indicates, John,

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:24.050
what experts tell us is an advancement

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:26.319
in the Chinese airship military program,

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:27.787
that it's getting more sophisticated.

00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:28.088
Of course,

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:29.556
we've known for quite some time

00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:31.891
that they do have an airship program.

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:33.259
Americans know all too

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:35.328
well that they've been using Chinese

00:01:35.328 --> 00:01:36.062
spy balloons.

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:37.564
We saw back in January, February

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:39.766
that spy balloon across the country.

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:40.967
But a blimp is a lot

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:42.268
more sophisticated, it's

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:43.503
more maneuverable,

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:45.505
it's more nav of a navigable

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:46.840
as one expert.

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:47.474
But one expert

00:01:47.474 --> 00:01:47.941
we spoke with

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:50.844
likened it to a submarine in the skies,

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:52.645
which has its own,

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:54.280
we believe, a propulsion

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.748
and navigation system.

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:57.283
And what this blimp would do

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:57.951
is carry out

00:01:57.951 --> 00:01:59.285
what's called ISR,

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:01.287
intelligence, surveillance

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:02.055
and reconnaissance.

00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:03.923
So it really does represent,

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:05.158
according to a number of experts

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:06.192
we spoke with,

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:09.062
a real progress in their airship program

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:10.263
that they are doing

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:12.298
a lot more to advance it.

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:13.433
Now, blimps

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:15.268
would be a lot more advantageous

00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:16.169
on a number of levels

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:17.604
that are a lot cheaper

00:02:17.604 --> 00:02:19.172
than planes and satellites

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:21.107
that would carry out ISR.

00:02:21.107 --> 00:02:22.408
They can stay in the air

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:25.011
a lot longer than planes, of course.

00:02:25.178 --> 00:02:25.645
And John,

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:26.746
what's really interesting is also

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:27.981
what's around this blimp.

00:02:27.981 --> 00:02:29.048
There's that huge hangar,

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:30.650
that very long runway.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:31.151
And people

00:02:31.151 --> 00:02:32.552
we speak to say that

00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:33.620
that could be an indication

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:34.721
that they're actually building

00:02:34.721 --> 00:02:36.189
a much bigger

00:02:36.189 --> 00:02:38.124
and more sophisticated airship.

00:02:38.124 --> 00:02:39.092
There's a lot of construction

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:40.593
going on around there.

00:02:40.593 --> 00:02:41.327
So experts

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:43.830
certainly keeping a close eye on this.

00:02:44.264 --> 00:02:45.932
I did reach out to

00:02:45.932 --> 00:02:46.933
the Biden administration,

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:48.935
the CIA declined to comment.

00:02:48.935 --> 00:02:49.869
The National Security Council

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:50.537
did not comment.

00:02:50.537 --> 00:02:51.504
But I did speak to a senior

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:52.672
defense official

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:53.640
who said that

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.608
if it's visible from the sky,

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:57.177
you can be sure that we're tracking it.

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:57.810
John, yet

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.746
these pictures very revealing,

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:00.813
very interesting.

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:01.648
One defense expert

00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:02.749
I spoke with the last few weeks

00:03:02.749 --> 00:03:03.216
basically said

00:03:03.216 --> 00:03:04.217
the Chinese have found a way

00:03:04.217 --> 00:03:05.485
to exploit

00:03:05.485 --> 00:03:06.819
Western defenses

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:08.421
with the use of these airships.

00:03:08.421 --> 00:03:09.689
Alex Marquardt, terrific reporting.

00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:10.023
Thank you.

